OL,3,AThe Other Bennet Sister wraps filming
OL,4,AChristmas special
OL,5,
OL,6,FFilming has wrapped for a three-part
OL,7,FChristmas special of hit BBC TV show
OL,8,FThe Other Bennet Sister, as fans
OL,9,Feagerly await its return.
OL,11,FInspired by Jane Austen's Pride and
OL,12,FPrejudice, the first series - filmed
OL,13,Flargely in Wales - attracted 7.3
OL,14,Fmillion UK viewers in its first four
OL,15,Fweeks, while also having huge success
OL,16,Fin the US and Canada and on social
OL,17,Fmedia.
OL,19,FWelsh actress and creator of Gavin and
OL,20,FStacey, Ruth Jones, portrays the
OL,21,F"iconic" Mrs Bennet, with Richard E.
OL,22,FGrant playing her husband, Mr Bennet.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
