OL,3,AThe Other Bennet Sister wraps filming
OL,4,AChristmas special
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Monday, the show's TV producer
OL,7,FEdoardo Ferretti told fans on social
OL,8,Fmedia that the special had finished
OL,9,Ffilming.
